<title>CANADA: Moore cleared to proceed Peak bid.</title>
<headline>Moore cleared to proceed Peak bid.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moore Corp Ltd said on Wednesday it received U.S. government anti-trust clearance to proceed with its US$210 million tender offer for the shares of Peak Technologies Group Inc.</p>
<p>Moore's bid is slated to expire on May 27.</p>
<p>Moore said in April it would commence a tender offer for all outstanding Peak shares at US$18 each, subject to the tendering of at least a majority of outstanding Peak shares.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
